#: ../../tools/kegg_network_variant_tools.rst:63
#: 81613421ba3946c3ae883a2b145d3b56
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get detailed KEGG variant information including gene "
"name, mutation type (gain/loss of function), specific mutations with "
"ClinVar/dbSNP/COSMIC cross-references, associated signaling networks, "
"diseases, and targeted drugs. Example: hsa\\_var:673v1 (BRAF) returns "
"V600E and V600K mutations with ClinVar:13961, dbSNP:rs113488022, "
"COSM:476, linked to melanoma and thyroid cancer, targeted by dabrafenib "
"and encorafenib."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/kegg_network_variant_tools.rst:67
#: b494824e6db649e08cd223ec17c0e778
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"``variant_id`` (string) (required) KEGG variant ID. Can be with prefix "
"'hsa\\_var:673v1' or without '673v1'. Get IDs from "
"KEGG\\_search\\_variant. Format: {entrez\\_gene\\_id}v{variant\\_number}."
msgstr ""

