#: ../../tools/kegg_network_variant_tools.rst:94
#: 2586e0fa9e414feb960c17d1dcf27286
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search the KEGG NETWORK database for signaling pathway "
"networks by gene or keyword. KEGG NETWORK contains 800+ disease/drug-"
"associated molecular interaction networks representing signal "
"transduction pathways perturbed in cancer, infection, and other diseases."
" Returns network IDs (N#####) and pathway names. Example: searching "
"'EGFR' returns N00001 EGF-EGFR-RAS-ERK signaling pathway, N00006 "
"Amplified EGFR, etc."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/kegg_network_variant_tools.rst:98
#: 95b48a86646b4d34967ef8a970c7b94e
msgid ""
"``keyword`` (string) (required) Search keyword for network/pathway name "
"or gene (e.g., 'EGFR', 'RAS', 'p53', 'WNT', 'NOTCH'). Case-insensitive."
msgstr ""

