#: ../../tools/kegg_network_variant_tools.rst:128
#: 912b4dc3f23a40c2890e85faaad4b0f7
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search the KEGG VARIANT database for human gene variants"
" associated with disease. KEGG VARIANT catalogs gain-of-function "
"mutations, loss-of-function mutations, and other variants in human genes "
"linked to cancer and other diseases. Returns variant IDs and "
"descriptions. Example: searching 'BRAF' returns 673v1 (BRAF mutation) and"
" 673v2 (BRAF mutation). Use KEGG\\_get\\_variant for mutation details, "
"ClinVar/dbSNP cross-references, and associated diseases/drugs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/kegg_network_variant_tools.rst:132
